 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AWS CodeBuild API (2016-10-06). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Projects and report groups are configuration metadata: no build, batch, sandbox, report, webhook, fleet or source credential exists, and sources, roles and keys are stored without contacting them. StartBuild and other build APIs return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. BatchGetProjects and BatchGetReportGroups fail with ResourceNotFoundException when any identifier is missing instead of listing it as not found. Tags are set at creation only; tags and badgeEnabled in updates and sortBy/sortOrder are refused. Report groups hold no reports, so deleteReports has no further effect.",
  "title": "AWS CodeBuild (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2016-10-06"
 },
